	fi
fi
text But it's not as if I have a full day of work waiting for me every day of the week. There end up being times where there's nothing for me to do.
text One day, I try spending some money to fill that void.
text When I do, I realize that it helps me forget about everything else more than I expected it to.
text After that day, I work to save up money, use it to kill whatever free time I have, then start all over again.
text I start drinking. I start smoking.
setvar strS[1000] = "BG080"
setvar intA[1000] = 1
if intA[1000] == 0
	goto s52
fi
