		setimg {$strS[1004]}.png -7 -7
	fi
fi
text But whenever I take a look at reality, I feel like it's crumbling underneath my feet.
text Am I weaker than everyone else around me?
text Or is it just that I've experienced something more tragic than all of them?
text I can't figure out what it is, really.
text All I can say though, is that it's too much for me.
text So I lose myself by moving my body, then killing time.
text That way, I won't have a spare second to think.
