text @[Sanae]
text It's not about "rights." It's about your duty. As her parent.
text When the words come out of her mouth, I'm simply too ashamed to face her.
text @[Tomoya]
text ...And anyway, it'd be better for her if I wasn't around.
text @[Tomoya]
text ...It's not like she's attached to me or anything.
text I somehow manage to mumble a response.
sound OYZ.aac
text @[Sanae]
text No. Ushio is always missing you.
sound OZ0.aac
text @[Sanae]
text Because she never gets to be by her father's side.
text @[Tomoya]
text ...That's not true.
text @[Tomoya]
text I was never there to begin with...
