text You can, though. You can because you're a kind person, Tomoya-san.
text @[Tomoya]
text You think too highly of me, Sanae-san.
text @[Tomoya]
text I'm not cool, and I'm not kind. I'm weak and spineless, which ought to make me the kind of man you'd hate.
