text "Okay, then. I'll call you at tomorrow night."
text @[Tomoya]
text *Sigh*
text She keeps pestering me for a reply.
text @[Tomoya]
text (I can't believe how into this she is...)
text @[Tomoya]
text (How am I supposed to say "no"...?)
text In the end, I give in to the pressure. With a pained voice, I tell her...
text @[Tomoya]
text Okay... Thank you for setting this up.
text I admit defeat.
text While Ushio might come, she's attached to Sanae-san and the old man, so I doubt we'll have much interaction.
text I convince myself that I should enjoy it as a simple vacation.
