text ......
text ...No one is around.
text @[Tomoya]
text Sanae-saaaan!
text ......
text @[Tomoya]
text Old maaan!
text ......
text ...No reply.
text Did I forget to meet in the right spot?
text Could we have accidentally crossed paths as they were headed to my apartment?
text If that were the case, it seems strange for the door to be unlocked.
text There may not be many burglaries in this town, but at the very least, you'd still lock your door before you went out of town.
text ...I start to have a bad feeling.
text I enter the house without anyone inviting me in.
