text Once I get to the living room, I see a piece of paper placed on the table where I'd easily be able to find it.
text It's a note that's been left behind.
text I take it and begin to read it.
text ..."Dear Tomoya-san."
text ..."Something came up suddenly, so Akio-san and I will have to be out for a while."
text ..."So please go on the trip with Ushio and take good care of her."
text ..."Sanae Furukawa."
text ..."P.S. You'll find how to get there on the other side of this note."
text ......
text @[Tomoya]
text Agh...
text @[Tomoya]
text ...You've gotta be kidding...
music BGM08A.mp3
text @[Tomoya]
text Sanae-san lured me right into her trap...
text I sense someone else in the room and turn around.
