text As I do, I see a small child on the other side of the doorway. It's like she's trying to hide as she looks at me.
text She already has her backpack on and is all ready to go.
sound OZ9.aac
text @[Ushio]
text ...
text We stare at each other in silence.
text Ushio doesn't make any moves to approach me.
text @[Tomoya]
text Hey, so Sanae-san and the old man said they aren't going to be back for a while...
text @[Tomoya]
text What do you want to do?
sound OZA.aac
text @[Ushio]
text ...
sound OZB.aac
text @[Ushio]
text ...Sanae-san.
text She just barely opens her mouth.
text @[Tomoya]
text No, listen... Sanae-san isn't here.
sound OZC.aac
text @[Ushio]
text ...Akky.
text @[Tomoya]
text The old man isn't here, either.
