text ...
text She looks like she's about to cry.
text Well, of course she is...
text She was looking forward to this trip, but then the two of them suddenly disappeared.
text It's not my fault if she starts to cry.
text It's those two's fault for playing a prank on us like this.
text @[Tomoya]
text Hey, so, what do you wanna do?
