text @[Tomoya]
text You get it, right? The old man and Sanae-san aren't here.
sound OZH.aac
text @[Ushio]
text ...It's summer break, so I want to go.
text @[Tomoya]
text I'm sure you do, but you wouldn't want to go without the old man and Sanae-san there, right?
sound OZI.aac
text @[Ushio]
text ...Yeah.
text @[Tomoya]
text Right? So we can't go.
sound OZJ.aac
