text Her toy is there.
text A plastic turtle.
text When I look at it more carefully, I see that its broken pieces have been scattered across the floor.
text I pick it up.
text It seems to have a pulley that's used to move its head back and forth.
text But it's gone now.
text @[Tomoya]
text I see... So you were playing with this when you fell.
text @[Tomoya]
text And you broke it by falling on it.
text @[Tomoya]
text Hmm... I wonder if I can fix this with glue...
