text Ushio stays by my side the entire time that I fix it.
text @[Tomoya]
text There, done.
text @[Tomoya]
text But don't stick the pulley back in yet. The glue will get the whole thing stuck solid.
text @[Tomoya]
text Put this here for now and go play with something else.
text I put the toy on top of the table.
