text I take it from her and find that the pulley has been stuck right onto the turtle.
text @[Tomoya]
text Didn't I tell you not to do this until the glue dries...?
text @[Tomoya]
text Gahh. Now it's stuck and won't even move...
text @[Tomoya]
text See? Look how stupid you are.
text @[Tomoya]
text This is strong glue I used...
text I try to pry it apart, but the piece is too small for me to get a good grip on it.
text @[Tomoya]
text It's no use...
text @[Tomoya]
text You're gonna have to settle for this. Okay?
text I put the turtle back into her tiny hands.
